            <ArticleTitle>Spontaneous tumor lysis syndrome occurring in untreated uterine cancer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.gore.2017.09.008</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>•Tumor lysis syndrome is rare in solid tumors.•Tumor lysis syndrome is an oncologic emergency.•We present two cases of spontaneous tumor lysis syndrome arising in uterine cancer.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
